    "description": "<h3>Editorial correction / Nota corretiva — 28 October 2026</h3><p>Scope clarification: cross-domain correspondences are conceptual models unless explicit structures, preserved operations and derivations are supplied. Enumerating analogous layers does not alone establish a mathematical theorem. Minimum vertex degree alone does not establish an articulation point. Reported training gains, hardware performance and energy estimates require identified datasets, evaluation procedures, executable artifacts and uncertainty; they were not independently reproduced in this editorial review. These limitations do not establish that the numerical claims are false. Conceptual usefulness does not establish physical realization, consciousness or general intelligence. The historical PDF remains unchanged pending revision.</p><p>Reference: ZENODO-EDITORIAL-CORRECTION-2026-10-28-21520919</p>",
